557
00:47:49,828 --> 00:47:52,372
/Ssij mi pindola, jak ci wjadę w dupola

558
00:47:52,414 --> 00:47:54,833
/Ssij mi pindola, jak ci wjadę w dupola

559
00:47:54,875 --> 00:47:57,586
/Ssij mi pindola, jak ci wjadę w dupola

560
00:47:57,628 --> 00:48:03,342
